Usage: ruralz bundle <verb> [ARGS] [FLAGS]

Validate, render, diff, build, import, export and audit Bundles.

Verbs:
  audit     Security and best-practice findings
  build     Build a Revision, print its digest
  diff      Compare FROM with TO
  export    OpenAPI 3.x, Postman collection or DOT graph of a Bundle
  import    Routes and Upstreams from OpenAPI 3.x
  render    Render one Environment's one-file Bundle
  validate  Offline validation, source-mapped diagnostics

Run 'ruralz bundle <verb> --help' for details.
